    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5-on-5 basketball that is a cross between arcade and simulation basketball, reminding you of the 8 and 16-bit era games you loved but with added modern features and quality of life enhancements. Leave your all on the floor and lead your team to a title or build a dynasty to last years in the franchise mode. Fast-paced game play, detailed stats, franchise mode, fully-customizable rosters, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268280/extras/d00137757b5951ade211b65bca02e0c3.poster.avif?t=1748550894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268280/extras/d00137757b5951ade211b65bca02e0c3.webm?t=1748550894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268280/extras/d00137757b5951ade211b65bca02e0c3.mp4?t=1748550894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep single player modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer gameplay (Note: Local multiplayer requires 1 or more controllers)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI with basketball intuition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up and play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own team: custom logo, name, roster, arena/floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully-realized franchise mode - draft new players, develop them in a developmental league, manage contracts, trades, player aging, player morale, and more\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming retro pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay to win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most everything can be customized: length of a game, length of a season, fouls on/off, salary cap on/off and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
